# a brain progression: track 3 follows the brain, the brain's steps at scale 4 move the key
wait 200
spin ALGO 2
tap EDIT
tap SEL
turn SELECT 5
wait 40
shot brain_list.png
tap HOME
spin ALGO 6
expect trk 9
tap EDIT
wait 40
shot brain_page.png
spin K2 2
spin K3 1
wait 40
shot brain_key.png
tap SEQ
expect page Steps
turn SELECT 1
spin K3 3
turn SELECT -1
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
wait 40
shot brain_steps.png
tap PLAY
wait 2000
tap EDIT
wait 40
shot brain_playing.png
tap PLAY
